---
<!-- ── ISP PLANS ── -->
<section class="isp-plans" id="isp-plans">
  <div class="isp-plans-inner">
    <div class="stag-b">Internet Service Plans</div>
    <h2 class="sh-b">Straight-up internet.<br/><em>No games, no caps.</em></h2>
    <p class="sb-b" style="max-width:640px;margin-bottom:0">We're a licensed WISP — which means we own the network and set the rules. Net neutral, no throttling, no hidden fees. Wireless-first deployment means you're up in days, not months.</p>
    <div class="isp-grid">
      <!-- Basic -->
      <div class="isp-card">
        <div class="isp-plan-name">Basic</div>
        <div class="isp-speed">25</div>
        <div class="isp-speed-unit">Mbps symmetric</div>
        <div class="isp-from">Starting at</div>
        <div class="isp-price">$79</div>
        <div class="isp-price-unit">/month · no contract required</div>
        <div class="isp-divider"></div>
        <ul class="isp-features">
          <li>25 Mbps upload &amp; download</li>
          <li>Net neutral — zero throttling</li>
          <li>No data caps. Ever.</li>
          <li>Wireless-first deployment</li>
          <li>Business-grade router included</li>
          <li>Email &amp; phone support</li>
          <li class="isp-feat-dim">SLA / uptime guarantee</li>
          <li class="isp-feat-dim">Dedicated account manager</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="isp-btn isp-btn-ghost">Get Started →</a>
      </div>
      <!-- Standard — Popular -->
      <div class="isp-card popular">
        <div class="isp-popular-badge">Most Popular</div>
        <div class="isp-plan-name">Standard</div>
        <div class="isp-speed">100</div>
        <div class="isp-speed-unit">Mbps symmetric</div>
        <div class="isp-from">Starting at</div>
        <div class="isp-price">$149</div>
        <div class="isp-price-unit">/month · no contract required</div>
        <div class="isp-divider"></div>
        <ul class="isp-features">
          <li>100 Mbps upload &amp; download</li>
          <li>Net neutral — zero throttling</li>
          <li>No data caps. Ever.</li>
          <li>Wireless-first deployment</li>
          <li>Managed router + QoS tuning</li>
          <li>Priority phone &amp; email support</li>
          <li>99.9% uptime SLA</li>
          <li class="isp-feat-dim">Dedicated account manager</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="isp-btn isp-btn-solid">Get Standard →</a>
      </div>
      <!-- Business -->
      <div class="isp-card">
        <div class="isp-plan-name">Business</div>
        <div class="isp-speed">250+</div>
        <div class="isp-speed-unit">Mbps symmetric</div>
        <div class="isp-from">Starting at</div>
        <div class="isp-price">$299</div>
        <div class="isp-price-unit">/month · no contract required</div>
        <div class="isp-divider"></div>
        <ul class="isp-features">
          <li>250 Mbps+ upload &amp; download</li>
          <li>Net neutral — zero throttling</li>
          <li>No data caps. Ever.</li>
          <li>Wireless + hardened Ethernet option</li>
          <li>Managed router, QoS &amp; failover</li>
          <li>24/7 priority support</li>
          <li>99.99% uptime SLA</li>
          <li>Dedicated account manager</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="isp-btn isp-btn-ghost">Get Business →</a>
    </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RanchHand banner — full width below ISP tiers -->
    <div style="margin-top:24px;background:rgba(232,106,26,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(232,106,26,0.2);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:0.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--flame);margin-bottom:4px;">📡 Not in our service area yet?</div>
          <div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">RanchHand™ — Keep your ISP. Upgrade your network.</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;max-width:580px;">Our managed HowdyNET Gateway appliance works with any ISP — eliminating bufferbloat, filtering ads and content, and monitoring 24/7. Starting at $79/mo. When HowdyNET expands to your area, upgrading is seamless.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#ranchhand" style="font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--flame);color:var(--white);padding:13px 26px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(232,106,26,0.3);transition:background 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='var(--light-o)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='var(--flame)'">Learn About RanchHand →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="isp-footnote">
      All plans include professional wireless installation · Hardware at our procurement cost (no markups, ever) · Speeds are symmetric (same upload &amp; download)<br/>
      Need multiple locations, higher speeds, or a custom SLA? <button onclick="openQuoteModal()" style="background:none;border:none;color:var(--sky);font-weight:800;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:0.72rem;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;">Build a custom quote →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
